  "description": "KEYQAJ01 crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C60 H78 Eu4 N8 O38 Zn4,2(C1 H4 O1),5(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Eu1 (Eu) has 9 O neighbors; Eu2 (Eu) has 9 O neighbors; Zn1 (Zn) has 3 O neighbors; Zn2 (Zn) has 4 O neighbors; Eu3 (Eu) has 9 O neighbors; Eu4 (Eu) has 9 O neighbors; Zn3 (Zn) has 3 O neighbors; Zn4 (Zn) has 4 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 10 pairs, 2 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.378-3.903 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 92.34-125.02°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Zn4Eu4(L1)2(OAc)10(NO3)2(OH)4]. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 10 OAc (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 2 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 4 OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
